    "scope": "Portal Web API reads of the SharePoint document tables on hosted session F7's invented schema (pqf7_case with document management), signed in as a contact with Global read on sharepointdocument and sharepointdocumentlocation, the environment's SharePoint integration off: with Webapi/<table>/fields * (phase s0) and with explicit column lists (phase s1-loc-fields, a default SharePoint site, the table library and one location per record): select-less, $select, $filter and FetchXML reads with and without a regarding condition, the record's two document relationships as navigations, and the record itself. Projection: status, OData-Version, x-ms-request-id presence and Server-Timing, the error object, or the context, counts, nextLink presence and rows. Runs a and b."
